1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:02,930
Do you know the Ali Plateau?
你知道阿里高原吗？

2
00:00:03,730 --> 00:00:09,980
It is a very cold area which is nearly 5,000 meters above sea level in the western part of China.
那里是中国西部一个非常寒冷的地区，海拔将近5000米。

3
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:16,870
Qi Fabao, the “hero regiment commander for defending the border”, has guarded our land with his life there.
“卫国戍边英雄团长”祁发宝一直在那里用生命守护着我们的国土。

4
00:00:17,670 --> 00:00:22,570
Qi Fabao was born into an ordinary family in Wuwei City, Gansu Province.
祁发宝出生在甘肃省武威市的一个普通家庭。

5
00:00:23,370 --> 00:00:28,200
He was always a top student at school in his childhood and had a strong wish to join the army.
他小时候在学校里一直是尖子生，并且强烈希望参军。

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:31,840
At the age of 18, he realized his dream.
18岁时，他实现了自己的梦想。

7
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:38,750
He chose to set foot on the land of the Ali Plateau in Xizang and began his career of defending the border.
他选择踏上西藏阿里高原这片土地，开始了守卫边境的生涯。

8
00:00:39,550 --> 00:00:44,470
He said, “Not everyone can understand my choice, but I have never regretted it.”
他说：“不是每个人都能理解我的选择，但我从来没有后悔过。”

9
00:00:45,270 --> 00:00:50,580
For over 20 years, he has defended the border and experienced many life-and-death moments.
20多年来，他一直守卫着边境，经历过许多生死时刻。

10
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:56,290
When the communication lines didn’t work, he stood in the cold water for hours to repair them.
通信线路不通时，为了修复线路，他在冰冷的水里一站就是好几个小时。

11
00:00:57,090 --> 00:01:01,050
When facing the falling stones, he even used his body to stop them.
面对落下的石头，他甚至用身体去挡。

12
00:01:01,850 --> 00:01:06,580
Once in 2005, he rode a horse in the snow mountains to carry out a task.
2005年有一次，他骑着马在雪山中执行任务。

13
00:01:07,380 --> 00:01:11,320
His horse fell off a cliff, and he was thrown onto the edge of the cliff.
他的马跌下了悬崖，他被甩到了悬崖边上。

14
00:01:12,120 --> 00:01:15,460
His back was badly hurt, but the great pain never broke him.
他的背部伤得很重，但剧烈的疼痛从来没有把他击垮。

15
00:01:16,260 --> 00:01:20,890
More than 1,000 patrols saw his promise to defend the border of our land.
1000多次巡逻见证了他守卫祖国边境的承诺。

16
00:01:21,690 --> 00:01:26,890
With his youth and blood, Qi Fabao has written a chapter of loyalty and responsibility.
祁发宝用青春和热血书写了忠诚与责任的篇章。

17
00:01:27,690 --> 00:01:32,290
He shows us that loving our country is not empty words, but real actions.
他向我们表明，爱国不是空话，而是实际行动。
